approaching you, and you don't have many quivered projectiles because
you were throwing them at trash mobs, then you are worse off than if
you had avoided using projectiles on trash mobs.  In other words, I
think it's dangerous to throw projectiles at trash mobs unless you are
absolutely sure that you won't need those projectiles in the near
future.


